DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       This program is part of NNeettppbbmm(1).

       ssbbiiggttooppggmm  reads  an  image file in the native format used by the Santa
       Barbara Instrument Group (SBIG) astronomical CCD cameras, and  produces
       a PGM image as output.  Additional information on SBIG cameras and doc‐
       umentation  of  the  file  format  is  available  at  the   Web   site,
       http://www.sbig.com/ ⟨http://www.sbig.com/⟩ .

       ssbbiiggttooppggmm  recognizes some variation on the documented SBIG Type 3 for‐
       mat.  It allows any capitalization  in  the  header.   It  ignores  all
       whitespace  in the header except newlines.  So a header line can end in
       newline, CRLF, or the bizarre LF-CR actually required by the spec.


OOPPTTIIOONNSS
